Subject: [PATCH 1/2] =?UTF-8?q?=F0=9F=90=9B=20Disable=20Impeller=20on=20An?=
 =?UTF-8?q?droid=20for=20the=20Sony=20Walkman?=
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Impeller crashes with SIGSEGV in the Vivante GC7000UL shader compiler
(/vendor/lib64/libVSC.so, thread 1.raster) on the NW-WM1AM2, under
both Vulkan and OpenGL ES. Rendering with Skia avoids it.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01Vi6nrnAN1baNYA2a6uHmXt
---
 android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml | 5 +++++
 1 file changed, 5 insertions(+)

diff --git a/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml b/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
index 0830593..4dcbb3e 100644
--- a/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
+++ b/android/app/src/main/AndroidManifest.xml
@@ -45,6 +45,11 @@
         <meta-data
             android:name="flutterEmbedding"
             android:value="2" />
+        <!-- Impeller crashes in the Vivante GC7000UL shader compiler
+             (libVSC.so) on the Sony NW-WM1AM2, so render with Skia. -->
+        <meta-data
+            android:name="io.flutter.embedding.android.EnableImpeller"
+            android:value="false" />
         <!-- ADD THIS "SERVICE" element -->
         <service
             android:name="com.ryanheise.audioservice.AudioService"
